# SPA fallback for Netlify-style static hosts.
#
# NOTE: this file does NOTHING on Render — `_redirects` is a Netlify/Cloudflare
# convention, and Render serves it as an ordinary static file instead of acting
# on it. Relying on it here is what caused every page refresh on a deep link
# (/subscriber, /manager/reports, ...) to return a plain-text 404.
#
# The real fallback now lives in ../server.js, which serves the built app and
# returns index.html for any path without a matching file. This file is kept
# only so a deploy to Netlify/Cloudflare Pages still routes correctly.
/*    /index.html   200
